+From b81246d58005748e259c6a0cb0e73c7d90f5d24d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: AdsTable <50158033+AdsTable@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2026 02:32:24 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 14/18] chore: update CUSTOMIZATIONS.md with b4fde200c, add
+ components.css+.gitignore to merge script
