+From 42e1fb0d7c4548071e63b0ceb94ca4dc89b5b12e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: AdsTable <50158033+AdsTable@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2026 02:19:12 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 12/21] feat(agents): invalid provider marker in dropdown,
+ simplify modal
