-如果你将此工作区视为智能体的"记忆"，请将其初始化为 git 仓库（最好是私有的），以便身份和笔记得到备份。
+If you treat this workspace as the agent's "memory," initialize it as a git repository (preferably private) so identity and notes get backed up.
 
