Subject: [PATCH 03/26] =?UTF-8?q?chore(fork):=20harden=20merge-upstream=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=2010-step=20safety=20model?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 34 CustomFiles (was 14): added .githooks, .gitleaks.toml, zh-CN templates,
  base.css, storage.ts, CUSTOMIZATIONS.md, scripts/merge-upstream.ps1
- Fix: fetch upstream BEFORE patch generation (upstream/main must exist)
- Fix: BOM-free UTF-8 LF patches (WriteAllText, no Out-File -Encoding UTF8)
- Fix: backup tag instead of branch (permanent, survives deletion)
- Fix: merge into temp branch — main never touched until manual ff-only
- Fix: auto-detect CustomFiles drift (FAIL not WARN on unprotected files)
- Fix: git add -u not -A (avoids staging dev.docs/patches/ in merge commit)
- Fix: per-file restore error checking (not silent Out-Null)
- Fix: rollback instructions on every exit 1 after branch creation
- Add: scripts/merge-upstream.ps1 wrapper (delegates to dev.docs/scripts/)
- Add: cshtml_skills_UI_UX_frontend to .gitignore (moved to adstable.site)
