++From fd2282445fd3bdda1be166b530c6d8574bf02ec1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
++From: AdsTable <50158033+AdsTable@users.noreply.github.com>
++Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2026 02:41:08 +0100
++Subject: [PATCH 17/18] fix: unify error msgs, fix aria attrs, add pre-push
++ hook, format-patch in merge script, git rerere
