+++From 2052b418a93804d15d60dc995ff19525eda8b4e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+++From: AdsTable <50158033+AdsTable@users.noreply.github.com>
+++Date: Tue, 3 Mar 2026 03:15:41 +0100
+++Subject: [PATCH 20/21] docs: draft upstream PR plan for discussion
+++
