Subject: [PATCH 19/26] =?UTF-8?q?fix(ui):=20define=20process.env/cwd/platf?=
 =?UTF-8?q?orm=20stubs=20=E2=80=94=20fixes=20'process=20is=20not=20defined?=
 =?UTF-8?q?'=20in=20browser?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
